TB case notifications:2012
======================
2.1 - included New pulmonary laboratory-confirmed cases by smear or culture;
2.2 - included retreated pulmonary laboratory-confirmed cases by smear or culture;
2.8 - included pulmonary relapse smear or culture positive;
2.12 - included cases who initiated TB treatment abroad;
2.13 - included cases who are non-citizens

TB/HIV patients:2011 AND 2012
================
2.34 for 2012: Hazim Timimi (WHO/Geneva) on 2013-07-01 copied the number reported to UNAIDS. This is regarded as provisional until NTP reports its number.

Treatment outcomes (MDR-TB and XDR-TB cases):2010
================
"Not evaluated" included unconfirmed cases.

